    result: 'Bal Harbour Sanctuary represents the absolute peak of quiet oceanfront luxury, where world-class art and coastal architecture exist in seamless dialogue. The once-glaring living areas now possess an ethereal, gallery-quality luminescence that protects precious masterpieces while celebrating the beauty of the Atlantic. The clients describe their residence as a tranquil retreat where the pace of international life slows immediately upon arrival, enveloped in artisan craftsmanship and understated elegance.',
