    result: 'HOME IT is a radiant demonstration of how luxury interior design can elevate family living into an effortless art form. The adult living salons offer a sophisticated, calm oasis for entertaining that feels uncluttered and elegant, while the children\'s wing has become a joyful realm of imagination and play. The owners report that family life flows naturally and without friction, with every item having its designated place, proving that high design and active childhoods can coexist beautifully.',
